First of all, how did you get a +20 sword?  I've never been granted something
that high unless I was in debug mode.

But to answer the question; there is only ONE artifact per game.  Since
Stormbringer already existed it couldn't be created again.  You're stuck with
the one your God gave you.

To wish for it, you should only have to type "the blessed rustproof 
+1 stormbringer."  If you got a +20 though, I think that would be better.

